      "value": "have problems with rigidbodies too, in my case for having bone structures moving in sync with my arms, over time they get displaced for no reason. Same with some rigidbodies that i used for moving a separate bone dedicated to knee of one of my avatars a bit more naturally, even with fixed position enabled it gets displaced over time from its initial position.",
